{"id":"1a9a64dce00ebd76","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-compactness.md","title":"Compactness Theorem","display":"thm-compactness — Compactness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-compactness","aliases":["92-thm-compactness"],"display":"thm-compactness — Compactness Theorem","depends_on":["[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]","[[92-df-first-order-language]]","[[92-thm-completeness-fo]]","[[92-df-model]]","[[92-df-interpretation]]","[[92-df-sentence]]"],"source":"外部一般一阶逻辑；Kfoury §5, Theorem 33","source_status":"外部背景定理；附有限证明论证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-compactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-compactness — Compactness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b146f0add46bd47\" href=\"?note=0b146f0add46bd47\" title=\"92-df-language-indexed-semantics\">92-df-language-indexed-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b230b875687723ed\" href=\"?note=b230b875687723ed\" title=\"92-df-first-order-language\">92-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bf5133176eaa12c8\" href=\"?note=bf5133176eaa12c8\" title=\"92-thm-completeness-fo\">92-thm-completeness-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"外部一般一阶逻辑；Kfoury §5, Theorem 33"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部背景定理；附有限证明论证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struc}_L,\\models_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Struc}_L,\\models_L\\)</span> 见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0b146f0add46bd47\" href=\"?note=0b146f0add46bd47\" title=\"92-df-language-indexed-semantics\">92-df-language-indexed-semantics</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> 为原算术语言版本；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struc}_G,\\models_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Struc}_G,\\models_G\\)</span> 采用原定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_L\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_LT)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall T_0\\in[T]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\mathfrak M_0\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_L\\;(\\mathfrak M_0\\models_LT_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_L\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_LT)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall T_0\\in[T]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\mathfrak M_0\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_L\\;(\\mathfrak M_0\\models_LT_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_G\">\\(\\iota_G\\)</span> 的满足关系对应，保留原算术特例：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_G\\Phi)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Phi_0\\in[\\Phi]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\mathfrak M_0\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\;(\\mathfrak M_0\\models_G\\Phi_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_G\\Phi)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Phi_0\\in[\\Phi]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists\\mathfrak M_0\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\;(\\mathfrak M_0\\models_G\\Phi_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若每个有限子集有模型而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 无模型，一阶完备性给出从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 推出矛盾的有限证明。该证明只用有限多个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 公理，可靠性便使这些公理的模型满足矛盾，与前提冲突。反向由同一个模型满足全部有限子集。\n非标准模型例子实际使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\mathcal L_G[c]\">\\(L=\\mathcal L_G[c]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\iota_G[\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]]\\cup\\{c\\ne\\iota_G(\\bar n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(T=\\iota_G[\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]]\\cup\\{c\\ne\\iota_G(\\bar n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，而非把含新常量的句子放进原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>这是一般一阶逻辑背景，不是给定 Smullyan PDF 中的独立证明。可对照 <a href=\"https://www.cs.bu.edu/faculty/kfoury/UNI-Teaching/CS512/AK_Documents_Past_Semesters/compactness.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Assaf Kfoury, Compactness and Completeness, §5, Theorem 33</a>。本节点给出基于可靠性和完备性的有限前提论证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-language-indexed-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"0b146f0add46bd47","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"b230b875687723ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-completeness-fo","status":"resolved","id":"bf5133176eaa12c8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-completeness-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-language-indexed-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"0b146f0add46bd47","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$；$\\mathrm{Struc}_L,\\models_L$ 见[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOLang}_{92}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struc}_L,\\models_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struc}_G,\\models_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}compactness}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_L\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_LT)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall T_0\\in[T]^{<\\omega}\\;\\exists\\mathfrak M_0\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_L\\;(\\mathfrak M_0\\models_LT_0).","display":true},{"tex":"\\iota_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\;(\\mathfrak M\\models_G\\Phi)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\Phi_0\\in[\\Phi]^{<\\omega}\\;\\exists\\mathfrak M_0\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\;(\\mathfrak M_0\\models_G\\Phi_0).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"L=\\mathcal L_G[c]","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\iota_G[\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{PA}]]\\cup\\{c\\ne\\iota_G(\\bar n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false}],"bytes":2117,"backlinks":[{"id":"8757635b793ed303","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fcf794bdb0764404","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"语言、有限树公式、语义和约化见[[92-df-language-indexed-semantics]]。数项在新语言中的使用均指解析翻译 $\\iota_G(\\bar n)$；算术结构约化后以相同解释数据读回本地 G 结构。紧致性使用[[92-thm-compactness]]的任意语言版本。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-267","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-compactness]]"}],"outgoing":["0b146f0add46bd47","b230b875687723ed","bf5133176eaa12c8","fd60117fc80e6f95","2b7f27c890af1dc3","90f32e29c9d553ed"]}